# HowTo 004: Extract Colors and Read the Result Panel
This guide explains what happens when you click **Extract Colors**.

## Two valid extraction flows
1. **With selection**: You brushed an area first.
2. **Without selection**: You did not brush anything.

Both are valid.

## Important behavior (no selection)
If no pixels are selected, the app still extracts colors from the **whole image**.
You get a short snackbar info message to make this clear.

## Step-by-step
1. Load an image.
2. (Optional) Paint an area with Brush.
3. Click **Extract Colors**.
4. Look at the **Extracted Colors** panel on the right.

## What you should see in the panel
- Color swatches with hex values
- Copy mode controls (**Single** / **Multi**)
- CSS prefix input
- Export buttons

